.TH SANCHALA-COLORPICKER 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-colorpicker \- Screen color picker and palette manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-colorpicker
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pick colors from anywhere on screen with support for HEX, RGB, HSL formats.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B pick
Pick color from screen (click anywhere)
.TP
.B history
Show recently picked colors
.TP
.B palette \fIname\fR
Save/load color palettes
.TP
.B convert \fIcolor\fR
Convert between color formats
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-colorpicker pick
.TP
sanchala-colorpicker convert "#FF5733"
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
